=== err no args
usage: tycho-dupe [--min-size N] [--top N] [--json] PATH...
  --min-size N  ignore files smaller than N bytes (default 1)
  --top N       show at most N duplicate sets (default all)
  --json        emit machine-readable JSON instead of text
  --help        show this message

Duplicate sets are ordered by bytes reclaimable, then by hash.
Exit 0 on a completed scan, 2 on bad usage or an uninspectable root.
